    "scenesThatPass": [
      "LORRAINE: Are you calling me from work? I thought you were going home first?\nANGELA: I brought everything with me.\nLORRAINE: Get out of here...",
      "LORRAINE: Vinny and Josie just got here. you shouldn't have, thank you...\nANGELA: OK, I'll see you later...\nLORRAINE: Please don't be late.\nANGELA: I won't. Bye.",
      "LORRAINE: Angela?\nANGELA: I... I... I'm not feeling well.\nLORRAINE: What do you mean? We're all waiting for you.\nANGELA: I was waiting for a cab in the cold and I... I felt really feverish...",
      "LORRAINE: Be quiet. Where are you, Angela?\nANGELA: I'm home. I went home."
    ]
